type: dataset
title: '婦嬰新說 / Fu ying xin shuo [New Treatise on Women and Infants]: Bodleian Sinica 1792 transcription dataset'
version: 0.3.0
url: https://github.com/poplolioi11/bodleian-sinica1792-fuying-xinshuo-1858
authors:
- family-names: Chu
  given-names: Chen-Yu
